OL,3,GNEWSAParakeets found shot by catapults
OL,4,Ain London park
OL,5,
OL,6,FGroups of youths using catapults are
OL,7,F"lamping" and killing sleeping
OL,8,Fparakeets in a south-east London park,
OL,9,Fan animal rescue worker has warned.
OL,11,FRae Gellel, director of the Greenwich
OL,12,FWildlife Network, said 43 ring-necked
OL,13,Fparakeets have been recovered dead from
OL,14,FPriory Gardens in Orpington over a
OL,15,Fthree-week period, including five found
OL,16,Fon Monday.
OL,18,FShe said the birds roost together in
OL,19,Ftrees at night, making them easy
OL,20,Ftargets for the culprits who shine
OL,21,Fbright lights at them to stun them
OL,22,Fbefore shooting them with catapults.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
