OL,3,GNEWSAParakeets found shot by catapults
OL,4,Ain London park
OL,5,
OL,6,FBromley Council said the killing of the
OL,7,Fbirds "continues to be a concern" that
OL,8,Fit is assisting the police in its
OL,9,Finvestigation.
